                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>环节六</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>反馈与维护</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>记录修改影响，保留原始事实</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 155, height: 62, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#20344B' }}>维护安排</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 88, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 22px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 56, background: '#276FBF' }} />
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, width: 1060 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>这些环节组织作者的工作，不规定 Brain 的调用顺序</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>Brain 仍按 SOP 决定调用顺序，Runtime 仍按原有合同提交事实；本案例也尚未执行。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>5.1 项目范围与委托</Text>
